OL,5,G1200 Martin Clunes: A Man and His Dogs
OL,6,     FTravelling across the globe,
OL,7,     FMartin meets a rat-catcher and a
OL,8,     Fsinging dingo, and reveals how
OL,9,     Fdogs are genetically similar to
OL,10,     Fwolves.
OL,11,G1300 Martin Clunes: A Man and His Dogs
OL,12,     FMartin explores how dogs'
OL,13,     Fabilities have been harnessed to
OL,14,     Fgood effect in pursuits ranging
OL,15,     Ffrom tracking and herding to
OL,16,     Fassisting the police and people
OL,17,     Fwith disabilities.
