OL,5,G1800 Frozen Planet
OL,6,     FWinter: During winter most animals
OL,7,     Fabandon the polar regions, but a
OL,8,     Ffew extreme survivors remain. This
OL,9,     Fis the story of their battles to
OL,10,     Fendure the planet's harshest
OL,11,     Fwinters.
